# IRToolKit - keep real evidence, generated output, and local artifacts out of the repo.
# The kit reads logs and writes reports; nothing an analyst produces at run time belongs in git.

# ---- Generated reports / hunt output (Invoke-IRHunt, -OutputPath, Export-IRFindings) ----
Results/
results/
Report/
Reports/
Output/
out/
IRHunt-*.csv
IRHunt-*.json
IRHunt-*.html
Find-*-[0-9]*.csv
Find-*-[0-9]*.json
Find-*-[0-9]*.html
Get-IRAuditReadiness-*.csv
Get-IRAuditReadiness-*.json
Get-IRAuditReadiness-*.html

# ---- Single-file builds (regenerate with Build-Standalone.ps1) ----
dist/

# ---- Collected evidence / logs - NEVER commit real event data ----
*.evtx
*.evt
Evidence/
evidence/

# ---- Exported / imported event sets that may contain real data ----
# (the fake fixtures under Tests/SampleData are intentionally tracked and must stay)
*.evtx.json

# ---- Local / editor / OS cruft ----
*.log
.vscode/
.vs/
*.user
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
